{"type":"message","id":"47ecd337","parentId":"a7272957","timestamp":"2026-03-29T14:57:20.971Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"录入成功！已将这道理科液体压强题目录入到错题本中了。record_id 是 recvfgI8jG4FDk。让我总结一下给频哥。","thinkingSignature":"3063751a0c6c5fea9ac88b6bf45b9ec592acf1937ccd52495479a096d6c5d9d9"},{"type":"text","text":"录入完成 ✅\n\n这是一道**初二物理液体压强**的综合题，题目来自2025年陕西延安期中考试。\n\n**答案：** ① 小于 ② 向上 ③ 0.24m\n\n**涉及的知识点：** 液体压强公式 P=ρgh + 压力平衡分析\n\n这道题第二、三问需要根据压强平衡列方程计算，属于中等难度。\n\n需要我把这道题的详细解析也补充到备注里吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":8520,"output":138,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":39632,"cost":{"input":0.0025559999999999997,"output":0.0001656,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00458004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774796235966,"responseId":"061870cc475ecc8147e86b6bdcb1acdb"}}
