{"type":"message","id":"ec8936e4","parentId":"31731912","timestamp":"2026-03-29T14:59:11.154Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"录入完成。这道题是基础题，答案很简单。","thinkingSignature":"07e6958a9ec2acdc6b07e6b01f669f2e4574d927cd000f22aa8d17380956c36e"},{"type":"text","text":"录入完成 ✅\n\n**答案：** ③ 黄河 ④ 光照充足，昼夜温差大\n\n这道题属于**容易**级别的常识题。宁夏平原能被叫\"塞上江南\"，正是因为有贺兰山挡住沙漠+黄河水灌溉，而瓜果甜则是西北地区的典型特征——昼夜温差大有利于糖分积累。\n\n要补充解析吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":10811,"output":90,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41875,"cost":{"input":0.0032432999999999997,"output":0.000108,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005209739999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774796346249,"responseId":"0618713a09ac79661fb3da4e567db637"}}
