{"type":"message","id":"678fad02","parentId":"d7420f57","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:24:22.045Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this second biology image.","thinkingSignature":"53ada8bdd9d5c14b8915c19a2e8d7a209d5cd1bef20476c54aca7e2464436ff2"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lcy5putda2zb_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张生物图片的内容，包括所有文字标注、结构名称、图中展示的生物学内容。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6fa5ea81-896a-4b08-a56a-7344eb652c13.png"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":95,"cacheRead":60420,"cacheWrite":1921,"totalTokens":62563,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00011399999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0036252,"cacheWrite":0.000720375,"total":0.004497675}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774797852973,"responseId":"0618771defda3d6dd9c1a384d35db09d"}}
{"type":"message","id":"742e76fe","parentId":"678fad02","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:24:29.017Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_lcy5putda2zb_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一张关于**植物细胞结构**的生物教学示意图。\n\n### 一、 文字内容\n1.  **大标题**：位于图片右上角，文字为“**植物细胞结构示意图**”。\n2.  **左上角题目**：\n    *   题干：“2．右图为植物细胞结构模式图，图中含有叶绿体的结构是（  ）”\n    *   选项：A. ①  B. ②  C. ③  D. ④\n\n### 二、 图中数字标注及其对应的细胞结构\n根据植物细胞的典型形态和结构，图中各数字代表的含义如下：\n*   **① 细胞壁 (Cell Wall)**：位于细胞最外层，起保护和支持作用。\n*   **② 叶绿体 (Chloroplast)**：图中呈椭圆形、内部有类似叠放盘状结构的小器官。它是植物进行光合作用的场所，含有叶绿素。\n*   **③ 细胞核 (Nucleus)**：图中较大的圆形深色结构，是遗传物质储存和复制的中心。\n*   **④ 液泡 (Vacuole)**：图中占据细胞中央大部分空间的囊泡状结构，内含细胞液，调节细胞的渗透压。\n*   **⑤ 细胞质 (Cytoplasm)**：图中基质部分，是细胞进行生命活动的主要场所（箭头指向细胞核与液泡之间的区域）。\n\n### 三、 题目解析\n*   **问题**：图中含有叶绿体的结构是？\n*   **答案**：**B. ②**\n*   **解析**：结构②具有明显的双层膜特征及内部的基粒（类囊体堆叠），这是叶绿体的典型解剖特征。\n\n### 四、 生物学内容总结\n该图展示了一个成熟的、典型的**高等植物细胞**模型：\n1.  **形态特征**：具有规则的外形（受细胞壁支撑）。\n2.  **关键特征**：\n    *   拥有**细胞壁**（①）。\n    *   拥有**大型中央液泡**（④），这是成熟植物细胞的显著特征。\n    *   含有**叶绿体**（②），表明这是一个能进行光合作用的绿色植物细胞。\n    *   具有明显的**细胞核**（③）。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6fa5ea81-896a-4b08-a56a-7344eb652c13.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774797869010}}
{"type":"message","id":"f0c5fa07","parentId":"742e76fe","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:24:34.281Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a plant cell structure diagram, showing numbered organelles:\n① Cell Wall\n② Chloroplast (contains chlorophyll, for photosynthesis)\n③ Nucleus\n④ Vacuole\n⑤ Cytoplasm\n\nThe question asks which structure contains chloroplasts, answer is ②.\n\nThis is a classic biology diagram for middle school. Let me save it.","thinkingSignature":"555a0e88296c313ae1d01e2f8aa8de02cf35ed4ef0c824d05b88c63ca1a5ebf5"},{"type":"text","text":"植物细胞结构模式图，标注①~⑤：细胞壁、叶绿体、细胞核、液泡、细胞质。典型中考识图题素材！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_y9l262bh2ner_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6fa5ea81-896a-4b08-a56a-7344eb652c13.png \"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/教辅素材库/生物/植物细胞结构模式图.png\" && echo \"Done\" && ls -la /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/教辅素材库/生物/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":32067,"output":212,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63253,"cost":{"input":0.0096201,"output":0.0002544,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011732939999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774797869018,"responseId":"0618772d9fc253f5040a8a90a4ceaea3"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ea385583","parentId":"f0c5fa07","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:24:34.319Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_y9l262bh2ner_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done\ntotal 1712\ndrwx------  4 edy  staff     128 Mar 29 23:24 .\ndrwx------  8 edy  staff     256 Mar 29 23:24 ..\n-rw-------  1 edy  staff  270720 Mar 29 23:24 植物细胞结构模式图.png\n-rw-------  1 edy  staff  601953 Mar 29 23:24 渗透作用_萝卜条天平实验.png"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":17,"aggregated":"Done\ntotal 1712\ndrwx------  4 edy  staff     128 Mar 29 23:24 .\ndrwx------  8 edy  staff     256 Mar 29 23:24 ..\n-rw-------  1 edy  staff  270720 Mar 29 23:24 植物细胞结构模式图.png\n-rw-------  1 edy  staff  601953 Mar 29 23:24 渗透作用_萝卜条天平实验.png","cwd":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774797874315}}
{"type":"message","id":"fcb36686","parentId":"ea385583","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:24:38.234Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Let me update the README to include the biology images, and then ask if there are more.","thinkingSignature":"5ac36dbdd61a8fee776e2b678c86b07db986ca3e8edac987208d0af648ea9ebf"},{"type":"text","text":"\n存好 ✅\n\n这张图高频使用！适合出：\n- 叶绿体/细胞核/液泡/细胞壁识别\n- 植物细胞 vs 动物细胞对比\n- 光合作用/渗透压相关基础\n\n还有其他生物图吗？一起收完 😊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":32403,"output":81,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":63458,"cost":{"input":0.0097209,"output":0.00009719999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01167654}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774797874319,"responseId":"061877325519c416ef03a59eef1d684b"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f6b3aa8b","parentId":"fcb36686","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:24:40.522Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/9a9daec6-723f-43ab-b324-8a47839b4542.png (image/png) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/9a9daec6-723f-43ab-b324-8a47839b4542.png]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 23:24:39 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a071c174a0c4962c6942cec2b, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a071c174a0c4962c6942cec2b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 23:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/9a9daec6-723f-43ab-b324-8a47839b4542.png"}],"timestamp":1774797880518}}
{"type":"message","id":"6dec760a","parentId":"f6b3aa8b","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:24:46.401Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this image.","thinkingSignature":"829f81b6b313c6f7c68787b9a29ce274fc46a8655c56a21a88e723f969b7e185"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_h6poje204pbb_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张生物图片的内容，包括所有文字标注、图中结构、生物学过程或实验内容。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/9a9daec6-723f-43ab-b324-8a47839b4542.png"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":94,"cacheRead":62245,"cacheWrite":1434,"totalTokens":63900,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00011279999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0037346999999999997,"cacheWrite":0.00053775,"total":0.0044233499999999995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774797880526,"responseId":"061877380f4dc01f8a55d2c3ad333645"}}
{"type":"message","id":"d6430ec6","parentId":"6dec760a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:25:12.435Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_h6poje204pbb_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这份图片是一个关于**植物细胞结构**的生物学练习题。它包含一张植物细胞的模式图，并配有五个相关的填空题。\n\n以下是图片的详细内容描述：\n\n### 一、 标题 (Title)\n位于图片右上角，文字为：**“植物细胞结构示意图”** (Schematic Diagram of Plant Cell Structure)。\n\n### 二、 细胞结构图 (Cell Diagram)\n图中展示了一个典型的矩形植物细胞，并用五个带有圆圈数字的箭头指向不同的细胞结构：\n\n*   **① 指向：** 细胞最外层厚实的边界，即**细胞壁** (Cell Wall)。\n*   **② 指向：** 紧贴在细胞壁内侧的一层极薄的膜，即**细胞膜** (Cell Membrane)。\n*   **③ 指向：** 细胞内体积较大、颜色较深的球形结构，即**细胞核** (Nucleus)。\n*   **④ 指向：** 细胞中央占据大部分空间的大型透明区域，即**液泡** (Vacuole)。\n*   **⑤ 指向：** 分布在细胞质中的绿色椭圆形小体，即**叶绿体** (Chloroplasts)。图中绘出了多个此类结构。\n*   **未标注但可见的结构：** 细胞内填充在各细胞器之间的液体部分，即**细胞质** (Cytoplasm)。\n\n### 三、 文字题目 (Text Questions)\n图片左侧是练习题的内容：\n**26. (5分) 右图是植物细胞结构示意图，据图回答：** (26. (5 points) The figure on the right is a schematic diagram of plant cell structure. Answer based on the diagram:)\n\n1.  **(1) 图中②是_______，它具有支持和保护作用。**\n    *   *生物学分析：* 虽然题目文字说②具有支持和保护作用（这通常是细胞壁的功能），但图中箭头②指向的是内侧的细胞膜。这可能是题目设计中的一个小失误或对位置的不同界定。通常而言，具有支持保护作用的是细胞壁（编号①）。\n2.  **(2) 控制细胞内外物质进出的是图中标号____。**\n    *   *生物学分析：* 指控制物质进出的结构是**细胞膜**。根据图中箭头，应填入编号 **②**。\n3.  **(3) 叶绿体存在于图中标号____内。**\n    *   *生物学分析：* 叶绿体分布在**细胞质**中。图中虽然没有专门给细胞质标号，但叶绿体本身被标为 **⑤**。\n4.  **(4) 细胞生命活动的控制中心是标号____。**\n    *   *生物学分析：* 细胞的控制中心是**细胞核**，即图中编号 **③**。\n5.  **(5) 储存糖分和色素的结构是标号____。**\n    *   *生物学分析：* 植物细胞中储存细胞液（含糖分、色素等）的结构是**液泡**，即图中编号 **④**。\n\n### 总结\n这张图片主要用于测试学生对植物细胞基本结构及其相应生理功能的掌握情况，涵盖了细胞壁、细胞膜、细胞核、液泡和叶绿体这五个关键组成部分。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/9a9daec6-723f-43ab-b324-8a47839b4542.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774797912428}}
{"type":"message","id":"996ae25c","parentId":"d6430ec6","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:25:18.636Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is another plant cell structure diagram, similar to the previous one but with slightly different labeling (①②③④⑤ pointing to cell wall, cell membrane, nucleus, vacuole, and chloroplasts). It has a 5-point fill-in-the-blank exercise (26题).\n\nThis is also a typical biology exam question material. I should save it as well.","thinkingSignature":"78bd67625b8053c5b14b8592df9ef79e0947436e3785b4fa314a5f10bdd5e52a"},{"type":"text","text":"又是植物细胞结构图，不过标注顺序不同（①细胞壁、②细胞膜、③细胞核、④液泡、⑤叶绿体），配了26题5分填空题。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_0i2o0ok9ylfo_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/9a9daec6-723f-43ab-b324-8a47839b4542.png \"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/教辅素材库/生物/植物细胞结构_26题填空.png\" && echo \"Done\" && ls -la /Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/教辅素材库/生物/"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":33582,"output":225,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64781,"cost":{"input":0.0100746,"output":0.00027,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012203039999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774797912436,"responseId":"061877581814c2ba304c847a12c00ad3"}}
