{"type":"message","id":"59212f2a","parentId":"da1d484c","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:25:22.155Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Let me update the README for the biology section.","thinkingSignature":"7d17b7f23fa0285bfd8347c87dcb5e742a7a659ebe8b913910d5edded46f2b8e"},{"type":"text","text":"存好 ✅\n\n这两张植物细胞图**内容相似但标注不同**，可以对比出题用——同一个图不同标注方式，测学生是否真正理解而不是死记编号。\n\n还有吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":33962,"output":57,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":64993,"cost":{"input":0.010188599999999999,"output":0.0000684,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012115439999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774797918675,"responseId":"0618775ec9cfceb362f7e550ee40b8a4"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a39149bc","parentId":"59212f2a","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:25:25.182Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/03287622-8ae0-403f-a320-7e4a8e414ae9.png (image/png) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/03287622-8ae0-403f-a320-7e4a8e414ae9.png]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 23:25:24 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a071c09ca4c11c1d0aeccedbc, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a071c09ca4c11c1d0aeccedbc\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 23:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/03287622-8ae0-403f-a320-7e4a8e414ae9.png"}],"timestamp":1774797925172}}
{"type":"message","id":"b139d20e","parentId":"a39149bc","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:25:29.733Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this biology image.","thinkingSignature":"8585110e108e3d9a62105107ebc027e18bde99925877a1de6c6128b6aa87f34d"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xfhg53neqm3p_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张生物图片的内容，包括所有文字标注、图中结构、生物学过程或实验内容。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/03287622-8ae0-403f-a320-7e4a8e414ae9.png"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":95,"cacheRead":63336,"cacheWrite":1887,"totalTokens":65445,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00011399999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0038001599999999995,"cacheWrite":0.000707625,"total":0.004659884999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774797925188,"responseId":"06187765d07432f43443a9a0a2852417"}}
{"type":"message","id":"656ea41c","parentId":"b139d20e","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:25:46.237Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_xfhg53neqm3p_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片是一份关于人体心脏结构和血液循环的生物练习题。图片分为左右两个部分：右侧是心脏结构示意图，左侧是相关的填空练习题。\n\n以下是图片的详细内容描述：\n\n### 一、 右侧：心脏结构示意图 (Diagram of the Heart)\n\n这是一个心脏的纵切面示意图，展示了心脏内部的四个腔室、主要血管以及瓣膜。图中带有箭头，指示了血液流动的方向。\n\n**1. 标注的四个心腔 (Numbered Chambers):**\n*   **[1]：右心房 (Right Atrium)** - 位于心脏右上部（图像左侧），接收来自全身的静脉血。\n*   **[2]：右心室 (Right Ventricle)** - 位于心脏右下部（图像左侧），将血液泵入肺动脉。\n*   **[3]：左心房 (Left Atrium)** - 位于心脏左上部（图像右侧），接收来自肺部的动脉血。\n*   **[4]：左心室 (Left Ventricle)** - 位于心脏左下部（图像右侧），拥有最厚的心肌壁，将血液泵入主动脉。\n\n**2. 标注的血管 (Labeled Vessels):**\n*   **上下腔静脉入口 (Entry of Superior and Inferior Vena Cava):** 指向进入右心房的血管。\n*   **主动脉 (Aorta):** 心脏顶端最粗的血管，从左心室发出，将含氧丰富的血液运往全身。\n*   **肺动脉 (Pulmonary Artery):** 从右心室发出，分支通往左右肺部。\n*   **肺静脉 (Pulmonary Veins):** 将来自肺部的血液送回左心房。\n\n**3. 其他结构标注 (Other Structures):**\n*   **房室瓣 (Atrioventricular Valves):** 分别位于心房与心室之间（[1]与[2]之间，以及[3]与[4]之间），防止血液倒流。\n*   **室间隔 (Interventricular Septum):** 位于左、右心室之间的厚实肌肉壁，防止左右心室的血液混合。\n\n**4. 血液流动过程 (Biological Process):**\n图中的黑色箭头清晰地描绘了血液循环路径：\n*   **体循环一部分：** 血液从上下腔静脉进入**[1]右心房**，经过**房室瓣**进入**[2]右心室**。\n*   **肺循环开始：** 血液从**[2]右心室**泵入**肺动脉**流向肺部。\n*   **肺循环结束/体循环开始：** 来自肺部的血液通过**肺静脉**进入**[3]左心房**，经过**房室瓣**进入**[4]左心室**。\n*   **体循环：** 血液从**[4]左心室**泵入**主动脉**，流向全身各处。\n\n---\n\n### 二、 左侧：练习题内容 (Questions)\n\n题目编号为 27，总分为 5 分。题目要求根据右图回答问题：\n\n1.  **题目 (1):** 心脏的四个腔中壁最厚的是 `[ ]____`。\n    *   *解析：根据图片可见，[4]左心室的壁明显比其他腔室厚。*\n2.  **题目 (2):** 血液从心房流向心室时，不会倒流回心房，是因为有 `[ ]____`。\n    *   *解析：指图中标注的“房室瓣”。*\n3.  **题目 (3):** 肺循环的起点是 `[ ]____`，终点是 `[ ]____`。\n    *   *解析：起点是[2]右心室，终点是[3]左心房。*\n4.  **题目 (4):** 主动脉内流动的是____血。\n    *   *解析：主动脉内流动的是含氧丰富的动脉血。*\n5.  **题目 (5):** 左心房与左心室之间的瓣膜叫____，右心房与右心室之间的瓣膜叫____。\n    *   *解析：左侧为二尖瓣，右侧为三尖瓣。*\n\n### 总结\n这张图通过解剖示意图和配套问题的形式，考察了学生对**心脏解剖结构**（四腔、瓣膜、血管）、**心肌壁厚度与功能的关系**、以及**血液循环路径**（体循环与肺循环）的掌握程度。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/03287622-8ae0-403f-a320-7e4a8e414ae9.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774797946228}}
