{"type":"message","id":"f8793cb1","parentId":"3de341ae","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:25:54.721Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me check if there are more images. Let me ask the user.","thinkingSignature":"07d9a33f390d84a792c9cda46b0f9a790f87777fd457e9f6d89f30d44a223201"},{"type":"text","text":"存好 ✅\n\n这张图很经典——心脏四腔+肺循环路径，中考生物高频考点！\n\n还有其他生物图吗？一起收完 😊"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":35564,"output":50,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":66588,"cost":{"input":0.0106692,"output":0.000059999999999999995,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.012587639999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774797952092,"responseId":"061877804720d8423f34c899f2c48887"}}
{"type":"message","id":"5863a6c3","parentId":"f8793cb1","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:25:57.369Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/a98ca6ac-997a-4f20-a648-ce355b7b884d.png (image/png) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/a98ca6ac-997a-4f20-a648-ce355b7b884d.png]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 23:25:56 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a071c0b4a4c2b36cf677bdabf, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a071c0b4a4c2b36cf677bdabf\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 23:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/a98ca6ac-997a-4f20-a648-ce355b7b884d.png"}],"timestamp":1774797957364}}
{"type":"message","id":"71f409bb","parentId":"5863a6c3","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:26:04.737Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this image.","thinkingSignature":"829f81b6b313c6f7c68787b9a29ce274fc46a8655c56a21a88e723f969b7e185"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_we2vgam7000k_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张生物图片的内容，包括所有文字标注、图中结构、生物学过程或实验内容。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/a98ca6ac-997a-4f20-a648-ce355b7b884d.png"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":92,"cacheRead":64871,"cacheWrite":1987,"totalTokens":67077,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0001104,"cacheRead":0.00389226,"cacheWrite":0.000745125,"total":0.004785885}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774797957374,"responseId":"06187785f0cbb916d031f382f4865901"}}
{"type":"message","id":"cdbd2e46","parentId":"71f409bb","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:26:23.671Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_we2vgam7000k_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一张关于人体消化系统的生物结构示意图及其相关练习题。\n\n### **一、 图像结构与标注内容**\n图中展示了人体上半身的剖面，重点标注了消化系统的主要器官：\n*   **[1] 食道 (Esophagus)：** 连接口腔和胃的管状通道。\n*   **[2] 胃 (Stomach)：** 位于腹腔左侧，呈囊状，是消化道最膨大的部分。\n*   **[3] 肝脏 (Liver)：** 人体最大的消化腺，分泌胆汁。\n*   **[4] 小肠 (Small Intestine)：** 位于腹腔中部，盘曲较长，是消化和吸收的主要场所。\n*   **[5] 大肠 (Large Intestine)：** 围绕在小肠周围，主要吸收水分和形成粪便。\n*   **[6] 胰腺 (Pancreas)：** 位于胃的下方，分泌胰液。\n*   **[7] 胆囊 (Gallbladder)：** 位于肝脏下方，用于储存胆汁。\n\n---\n\n### **二、 练习题内容及解析**\n左侧文字为针对该图的简答题（共7分）：\n\n**30. 右图是人体消化系统结构示意图，据图回答：**\n\n*   **(1) 人体消化和吸收的主要场所是 [ 4 ] 小肠。**\n    *   *生物学原理：* 小肠长、内壁有皱襞和小肠绒毛，增加了接触面积，且含有多种消化液（胰液、肠液、胆汁）。\n*   **(2) 图中 [ 3 ] 肝脏 分泌的胆汁能促进脂肪的消化。**\n    *   *生物学原理：* 胆汁不含消化酶，但能乳化脂肪，使脂肪变成微小的颗粒，属于物理性消化。\n*   **(3) 图中 [ 1 ] 食道 是消化道中唯一没有消化液的结构。**\n    *   *解析：* 食道主要负责将食物从口腔输送到胃部，本身不产生任何消化液。\n*   **(4) 蛋白质在 [ 2 ] 胃 开始被消化，淀粉在 [ 口腔 ] 开始被消化。**\n    *   *注意：* 虽然图中未标注口腔（通常位于[1]上方），但根据生理常识，淀粉的消化起始于口腔（唾液淀粉酶）。胃液中的胃蛋白酶则初步消化蛋白质。\n*   **(5) 既无消化功能又无吸收功能的器官是 [ 1 ] 食道。**\n    *   *延伸：* 口腔有消化（淀粉）无吸收；胃、小肠既有消化又有吸收；大肠有吸收无消化（主要功能）；而食道和咽既不消化也不吸收。\n\n---\n\n### **三、 生物学过程总结**\n该图反映了食物在人体内的**消化路线**：\n1.  **口腔：** 机械研磨，淀粉初步分解。\n2.  **食道 [1]：** 蠕动运输。\n3.  **胃 [2]：** 暂时储存，蛋白质初步分解。\n4.  **小肠 [4]：** 营养物质（糖类、脂肪、蛋白质）在此被彻底分解并吸收进入血液。\n5.  **大肠 [5]：** 吸收残余的水分和无机盐，形成粪便并排出。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/a98ca6ac-997a-4f20-a648-ce355b7b884d.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774797983663}}
{"type":"message","id":"93cc5b9f","parentId":"cdbd2e46","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:26:28.821Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a digestive system diagram with numbered organs (1-7: esophagus, stomach, liver, small intestine, large intestine, pancreas, gallbladder), with a 7-point question 30 about the digestive system.","thinkingSignature":"4dc55d02fe2835df30cd559a13f5582e5890e03eecc9f5267297f90a993bdbfd"},{"type":"text","text":"人体消化系统结构图，标注1~7：食道、胃、肝脏、小肠、大肠、胰腺、胆囊，配30题7分问答，考消化和吸收的主要场所、胆汁作用、各器官功能。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_5ulvm6bzv2sr_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/a98ca6ac-997a-4f20-a648-ce355b7b884d.png \"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/教辅素材库/生物/人体消化系统结构.png\" && echo \"Done\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":36796,"output":173,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":67943,"cost":{"input":0.0110388,"output":0.00020759999999999998,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01310484}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774797983672,"responseId":"0618779f0cad46f89f81e9ff52caefbd"}}
