{"type":"message","id":"8d72ebaf","parentId":"682a508c","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:26:32.869Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done. Let me check if there are more images coming.","thinkingSignature":"0bbcc4248f118bfb202aec95aeb5ba47a99eab6b3646e52fd2ebee2e2515429f"},{"type":"text","text":"存好 ✅\n\n这张图也是中考高频——七大消化器官功能区分（消化vs吸收vs运输），特别是\"食道唯一无消化液\"这种考点经常出现。\n\n还有吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":36986,"output":55,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":68015,"cost":{"input":0.0110958,"output":0.00006599999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013020239999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774797988858,"responseId":"061877a551ad143f6209e8e7c8fb91b8"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b12b52d4","parentId":"8d72ebaf","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:26:35.035Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6906fc5b-0919-42bb-ba4c-cb52bdff58ac.png (image/png) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6906fc5b-0919-42bb-ba4c-cb52bdff58ac.png]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 23:26:34 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a071c0a8a4c4f003c419f75cd, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a071c0a8a4c4f003c419f75cd\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 23:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6906fc5b-0919-42bb-ba4c-cb52bdff58ac.png"}],"timestamp":1774797995031}}
{"type":"message","id":"172de871","parentId":"b12b52d4","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:26:40.037Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this image.","thinkingSignature":"829f81b6b313c6f7c68787b9a29ce274fc46a8655c56a21a88e723f969b7e185"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_lijr27ena4ww_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张生物图片的内容，包括所有文字标注、图中结构、生物学过程或实验内容。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6906fc5b-0919-42bb-ba4c-cb52bdff58ac.png"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":93,"cacheRead":66466,"cacheWrite":1808,"totalTokens":68494,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.00011159999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00398796,"cacheWrite":0.000678,"total":0.004815659999999999}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774797995040,"responseId":"061877ab7baa23df95f2fa7b7bc47057"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b5de191f","parentId":"172de871","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:27:01.800Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_lijr27ena4ww_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一张关于人体生理学中**肾单位（Nephron）结构及尿液形成过程**的生物教学示意图。\n\n图片分为左侧的题目部分和右侧的结构示意图部分。\n\n### 一、 右侧：肾单位纵切面示意图 (Schematic Diagram of a Nephron)\n\n该图详细展示了肾脏的基本功能单位——肾单位的构造及其工作原理。\n\n*   **区域划分：**\n    *   **皮质 (Cortex)：** 图中上方颜色较浅的区域。\n    *   **髓质 (Medulla)：** 图中下方红色背景的区域。\n*   **主要结构与标注：**\n    *   **入球小动脉 (Afferent arteriole)：** 标注为“红色粗”，是血液进入肾小球的通道。\n    *   **出球小动脉 (Efferent arteriole)：** 标注为“红色细”，是血液离开肾小球的通道。\n    *   **肾小球 (Glomerulus)：** 位于肾小囊内，是由入球小动脉分支形成的毛细血管球。\n    *   **肾小囊 (Bowman's capsule)：** 漏斗状结构，包绕在肾小球外面。\n    *   **肾小管 (Renal tubule)：** 肾小囊延伸出来的长管，在皮质和髓质间迂回。\n    *   **肾小管周围的毛细血管网 (Peritubular capillaries)：** 标注为“蓝色细管”，缠绕在肾小管周围。\n    *   **收集管 (Collecting duct)：** 标注为“右侧较粗垂直管道”，负责收集多个肾单位形成的尿液。\n    *   **肾盏 (Renal calyx)：** 标注为“收集管下方尿液汇集处”。\n*   **尿液形成的两大过程（箭头指示）：**\n    *   **红色箭头：** 代表血液流向 (Blood flow)。\n    *   **蓝色箭头：** 代表原尿流向 (Primary urine flow)。\n    *   **A 过程：** 箭头从肾小球指向肾小囊。这代表**肾小球的滤过作用**（或过滤作用），血液中的水分、无机盐、尿素、葡萄糖等物质被滤过到肾小囊中形成原尿。\n    *   **B 过程：** 箭头从肾小管指向周围的毛细血管。这代表**肾小管的重吸收作用**，原尿中绝大部分的水、全部葡萄糖和部分无机盐被重新吸收回血液。\n\n---\n\n### 二、 左侧：练习题目内容\n\n这部分是基于右图设计的填空题：\n\n**29. (5分) 右图是尿的形成过程示意图，据图回答：**\n\n*   **(1) 图中A过程表示____，B过程表示____。**\n    *   *解析：A为肾小球的滤过作用；B为肾小管的重吸收作用。*\n*   **(2) 与血浆相比，原尿中不含有____。**\n    *   *解析：答案通常为“大分子蛋白质”。（血细胞也不进入原尿，但题目强调与血浆对比）。*\n*   **(3) 某人尿检中发现葡萄糖，医生认为可能的原因是____分泌不足。**\n    *   *解析：答案为“胰岛素”。（胰岛素分泌不足会导致血糖浓度过高，超过肾脏重吸收能力，导致糖尿病）。*\n*   **(4) 尿素的排出过程：尿素 → 肾小球 → ____ → 输尿管 → 膀胱 → 尿道 → 体外。**\n    *   *解析：横线处应填写尿液在肾脏内的流动路径，通常填“肾小管、集合管”或“肾盂/肾盏”。根据图示逻辑，填“肾小管”或“肾盂”较为合适。*\n*   **(5) 血液流经肾小球时，经A过程后形成的液体叫____。**\n    *   *解析：答案为“原尿”。*"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6906fc5b-0919-42bb-ba4c-cb52bdff58ac.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774798021792}}
{"type":"message","id":"b42e854b","parentId":"b5de191f","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:27:09.596Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a nephron (kidney unit) structure diagram showing:\n- Cortex and medulla regions\n- Afferent arteriole (入球小动脉)\n- Efferent arteriole (出球小动脉)\n- Glomerulus (肾小球)\n- Bowman's capsule (肾小囊)\n- Renal tubule (肾小管)\n- Peritubular capillaries\n- Collecting duct (收集管)\n- Process A: Filtration (滤过作用)\n- Process B: Reabsorption (重吸收作用)\n\nThe accompanying questions are about urine formation, glomerular filtration, reabsorption, and diabetes related to insulin deficiency.\n\nThis is a classic biology diagram for the urinary system chapter.","thinkingSignature":"f9c29f06367926ee7c4cef8a0ab7d6a5e5849dbe03fbe8261e76687f1e750bfe"},{"type":"text","text":"肾单位结构图，展示尿的形成过程——A过程（肾小球滤过作用）和B过程（肾小管重吸收作用），配有29题5分填空，问原尿成分、胰岛素与糖尿病、尿素排出路径等。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_smd23cxu0uov_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/6906fc5b-0919-42bb-ba4c-cb52bdff58ac.png \"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/教辅素材库/生物/肾单位_尿形成过程.png\" && echo \"Done\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38336,"output":277,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69587,"cost":{"input":0.0115008,"output":0.0003324,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01369164}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774798021801,"responseId":"061877c5fb8722f30f6d25ed19fdb74e"}}
