{"type":"message","id":"48514361","parentId":"a49e18a3","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:27:12.947Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good. Let me check if there are more bio images to save.","thinkingSignature":"5a611e3f60e6a29f0efafbdb7c879ba8b5a6189b2e48d4ae904c9dcb7eb22b34"},{"type":"text","text":"存好 ✅\n\n肾小球滤过+肾小管重吸收，这个图把尿形成两大过程画得很清晰，中考生物高频！\n\n今晚生物图收完了吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38630,"output":54,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69658,"cost":{"input":0.011589,"output":0.0000648,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01351224}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774798029634,"responseId":"061877cdd40fe5beb60a2548e642b55a"}}
{"type":"message","id":"b6e0871e","parentId":"48514361","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:27:15.355Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/2b977f7e-5dd3-4f9b-b58f-8028cc2a0e9c.png (image/png) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/2b977f7e-5dd3-4f9b-b58f-8028cc2a0e9c.png]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 23:27:14 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a071c0dca4c4251b562043dfd, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a071c0dca4c4251b562043dfd\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 23:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/2b977f7e-5dd3-4f9b-b58f-8028cc2a0e9c.png"}],"timestamp":1774798035348}}
