{"type":"message","id":"1639af0d","parentId":"1bb88e38","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:27:59.394Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[media attached: /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/707af806-8a00-41ef-ada5-57968561ede2.png (image/png) | /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/707af806-8a00-41ef-ada5-57968561ede2.png]\nTo send an image back, prefer the message tool (media/path/filePath). If you must inline, use MEDIA:https://example.com/image.jpg (spaces ok, quote if needed) or a safe relative path like MEDIA:./image.jpg. Avoid absolute paths (MEDIA:/...) and ~ paths — they are blocked for security. Keep caption in the text body.\nSystem: [2026-03-29 23:27:58 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | 用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83) [msg:om_x100b53a071c0eca4c34523db1b6eb28, image, 1 attachment(s)]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b53a071c0eca4c34523db1b6eb28\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"sender\": \"用户612847\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Sun 2026-03-29 23:23 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"用户612847 (ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83)\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_2ad19bb3863e71e2d0eff5cc4aeedd83\",\n  \"name\": \"用户612847\"\n}\n```\n\n/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/707af806-8a00-41ef-ada5-57968561ede2.png"}],"timestamp":1774798079390}}
{"type":"message","id":"c3a93ebe","parentId":"1639af0d","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:28:06.474Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me analyze this image.","thinkingSignature":"829f81b6b313c6f7c68787b9a29ce274fc46a8655c56a21a88e723f969b7e185"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_xf15744obphg_1","name":"image","arguments":{"prompt":"请详细描述这张生物图片的内容，包括所有文字标注、图中结构、生物学过程或实验内容。","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/707af806-8a00-41ef-ada5-57968561ede2.png"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":91,"cacheRead":69536,"cacheWrite":1914,"totalTokens":71668,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0001092,"cacheRead":0.004172159999999999,"cacheWrite":0.0007177500000000001,"total":0.00503721}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774798079401,"responseId":"061877ff1d91e9825df142ae31c01848"}}
{"type":"message","id":"ed5ac8a7","parentId":"c3a93ebe","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:28:23.629Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_xf15744obphg_1","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片展示了一个关于“测定植物蒸腾作用”的生物实验装置图以及相关的填空和选择题。\n\n以下是对图片内容的详细描述：\n\n### 一、 实验装置图详解（右侧）\n\n这张图描绘了一个研究植物蒸腾作用的实验模型。\n\n*   **核心结构：**\n    *   **盆栽植物：** 中心是一个种在花盆里的绿色植物，放在一个**托盘**上。\n    *   **透明玻璃钟罩：** 一个大的透明玻璃罩扣在盆栽植物上方，将其密封。\n    *   **橡皮塞：** 钟罩顶部有一个开口，用黑色橡皮塞塞住。\n*   **生物过程标注：**\n    *   **水分运输：** 茎部有一个向上的蓝色箭头，标注为“水分运输”，显示水从根部（花盆中）向上移动。\n    *   **绿色叶片：** 指向植物的叶子。\n    *   **白色云雾状水汽：** 许多向上指向的小蓝色箭头从叶片表面发出，模拟水蒸气的释放。\n    *   **凝结水珠 / 壁凝结：** 钟罩内壁上画有蓝色的水滴，表示排出的水蒸气在玻璃内壁遇冷凝结。\n*   **测量部分：**\n    *   **橡皮管 A：** 一根透明导管从钟罩侧面伸出，向下弯曲插入旁边的烧杯中。图中用虚线圈出了管子的一部分。\n    *   **水汽从这里散失：** 指向橡皮管在烧杯中的开口处。\n    *   **小烧杯 / 盛水：** 管子末端插入一个盛有水的小烧杯中。\n\n### 二、 文字题目内容（左侧）\n\n左侧列出了六道关于此实验的练习题：\n\n*   **题目开头：** 33. (8分) 某同学做了“测定植物蒸腾作用”实验，装置如下图所示：\n*   **(1) 填空：** 该实验装置中，蒸腾作用散失的水分主要通过叶片的______散失。（*答案参考：气孔*）\n*   **(2) 填空：** 为使实验结果更明显，应选择______ (填“阳生植物”或“阴生植物”) 作为实验材料。\n*   **(3) 填空：** 一段时间后，小烧杯中水量增加，若用手指堵住橡皮管A处，液滴会向______(填“左”或“右”)移动。（*注：此题通常对应测量耗水量的装置，图示略有差异，意在考察气压变化*）\n*   **(4) 填空：** 植物的蒸腾作用对自身的意义是：①降低叶片温度；②促进______。（*答案参考：水分和无机盐的运输*）\n*   **(5) 多选题：** 以下措施中，能降低蒸腾作用的是（多选）：\n    *   A. 剪去部分枝叶\n    *   B. 阴天移栽\n    *   C. 及时浇水\n    *   D. 夏季中午高温时浇水\n*   **(6) 填空：** 为了更精确地测定蒸腾作用，建议增加一个对照实验装置，其设置应为______，以消除______等因素对实验结果的干扰。（*答案参考：不放植物/放一株假植物；土壤水分蒸发*）\n\n### 三、 总结\n\n这张图片完整地呈现了一个中学生物实验的情境。它通过直观的示意图解释了**蒸腾作用**的过程（根吸收水 -> 茎运输水 -> 叶片通过气孔散发水蒸气 -> 水蒸气液化），并结合题目考察学生对蒸腾作用定义、意义、影响因素以及实验设计原则（如单一变量和对照原则）的理解。"}],"details":{"model":"minimax/MiniMax-VL-01","image":"/Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/707af806-8a00-41ef-ada5-57968561ede2.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774798103620}}
{"type":"message","id":"5d4b5677","parentId":"ed5ac8a7","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:28:48.968Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a plant transpiration experiment apparatus diagram. It shows:\n- A potted plant under a glass bell jar\n- Water vapor escaping from leaves (transpiration)\n- Condensation on the glass jar walls\n- A rubber tube A for measurement\n- Questions about transpiration through stomata, using heliophytes vs shade plants, the effect of blocking the tube, significance of transpiration, ways to reduce transpiration, and control experiment design.\n\nThis is a classic plant physiology experiment on transpiration. Let me save it to the biology materials library.","thinkingSignature":"83e062d0cc7e2d535eea3115fdf3f3a0cc6e3d37fd425e355c0bf4aea609f98b"},{"type":"text","text":"蒸腾作用实验装置图——透明钟罩罩住盆栽植物，叶片水分以水蒸气形式散失并在罩壁凝结，配33题8分，考查气孔蒸腾、阳生/阴生植物选择、蒸腾作用意义、降低蒸腾措施、对照实验设计等。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tndveqct2ljw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cp /Users/edy/.openclaw/media/inbound/707af806-8a00-41ef-ada5-57968561ede2.png \"/Users/edy/.openclaw/workspace/教辅素材库/生物/蒸腾作用实验装置.png\" && echo \"Done\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":41464,"output":255,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72693,"cost":{"input":0.0124392,"output":0.000306,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01460364}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774798103631,"responseId":"06187829e412d503c54c5325407bff57"}}
