{"type":"message","id":"e7cfa340","parentId":"e67f0bb1","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:29:00.691Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Saved. Let me update the README for the biology materials library and then give a summary to the user.","thinkingSignature":"4407552b49737103e9d46dfd00e7701ed21a43bcbf81f2d8f91fd48e7a9a9cac"},{"type":"text","text":"存好 ✅\n\n这张图把蒸腾作用全过程（根吸收→茎运输→气孔散失→罩壁凝结）画得很直观，8分大题考点覆盖也很全。\n\n今晚生物图都收完了吗？统一更新下素材库目录 📂"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":41736,"output":81,"cacheRead":30974,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":72791,"cost":{"input":0.012520799999999999,"output":0.00009719999999999999,"cacheRead":0.0018584399999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014476439999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774798129006,"responseId":"06187839626227e4154161c363fff95d"}}
