{"type":"message","id":"a77e9d92","parentId":"17f33817","timestamp":"2026-03-29T15:37:37.417Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is acknowledging my summary - saying \"按需要吧，不一定都能复用\" which means \"use as needed, not everything can be reused.\" They're just confirming the pragmatic approach. Nothing specific to do here except acknowledge.","thinkingSignature":"b6bce85565a6eafdeb3700499ff066a2d3b9130303ebafe5059191636ee3c247"},{"type":"text","text":"对，实用主义——有合适的图就用，没有就现找或现画。今晚这批生物图质量不错，尤其是那几张结构图，留着慢慢用 💪"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":127,"output":84,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":73326,"totalTokens":73537,"cost":{"input":0.0000381,"output":0.0001008,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.02749725,"total":0.02763615}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774798650343,"responseId":"06187a3a8953f57070286579d89aa242"}}
